# Upper Case Methods

In Sᴘʟ,
capitalised method names are reserved for type _constructors_,
and generally have the name of the `Type` that they answer.

In SuperCollider,
unit generators are implemented as classes,
and class names are written capitalised.

This is not carried over for Sᴘʟ.

* * *

Guides: Pitch Functions, Unit Generators
